<div class="container mt-4">
  <h1>About Bed & Bones</h1>

  <p class="lead">Bed & Bones connects responsible pet owners with trusted sitters and short-term stays. We believe every pet deserves a comfortable, safe place while their humans are away.</p>

  <div class="row mt-4">
    <div class="col-md-8">
      <h3>Our Mission</h3>
      <p>We aim to make pet care simple and dependable by matching animals with hosts who provide a loving environment, experienced care, and peace of mind.</p>

      <h3>How it Works</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Create a listing for your pet or browse available hosts in your area.</li>
        <li>Filter by species and view detailed profiles for sitters and homes.</li>
        <li>Book securely and communicate directly with the host to share care instructions.</li>
      </ol>

      <h3>Safety & Trust</h3>
      <p>All hosts are verified and reviewed by previous guests. We require clear profiles, recent photos, and honest availability to build trust across our community.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h5 class="card-title">Need Help?</h5>
          <p class="card-text">Contact support or visit the <%= link_to 'Animals', animals_path %> page to start browsing.</p>
          <%= link_to 'Contact Support', contact_path, class: 'btn btn-primary' %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
